cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Chunking verdicts under count- and budget-matched retrieval: code, analysis plans and results"
abstract: >-
  Code, analysis plans, deviation logs, run manifests, per-query results and analyses for a multiverse analysis of how
  the retrieval-selection protocol (a fixed number of chunks or a fixed word budget) changes chunking verdicts in
  retrieval-augmented generation, with an extension to semantic chunking and dense retrieval and an exploratory
  answer-quality check. The source datasets are not included; a fetch script downloads them and checks their digests.
authors:
  - family-names: "Chand J C"
    given-names: "Swaroop"
